  "activation_requirements": [
    "Do not edit, reload, restart, rename or backfill the active V7 run.",
    "At V8 startup explicitly integrate metric_name_v2 at the W&B output boundary and record metric_schema_version=2 in the new run config/manifest.",
    "Keep simulator, rewards, validation files and model-selection keys unchanged; map only W&B names.",
    "Use the same mapping for journal/backfill deduplication and heldout-finalization markers, and make monitoring aware of v2 names.",
    "Verify a mock complete train/val/greedy/heldout logging flow before starting a new v2 run; never create both v1 and v2 aliases in one new run.",
    "Record final runtime/schema hashes in the V8 manifest. This schema is not authorization to start V8."
  ],
